<question-record>
<question>Si prendano in considerazione elettroni e protoni accelerati in un tubo a vuoto da differenze di potenziale uguali in valore assoluto ma di segno opposto. 

Se la velocit&amp;#x00e0; iniziale delle particelle &amp;#x00e8; trascurabile, quale delle sgeuenti affermazioni &amp;#x00e8; vera?</question>
<clue></clue>
<category></category>
<weighting>100</weighting>
<fixed>0</fixed>
<question-type>1</question-type>
<answers>
<answer><text>I protoni hanno minore quantit&amp;#x00e0; di moto.</text>
<feedback></feedback>
<correct>0</correct>
<percent-correct>0</percent-correct>
<include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options>
</answer><answer><text>Gli elettroni hanno minore velocit&amp;#x00e0;.</text>
<feedback></feedback>
<correct>0</correct>
<percent-correct>0</percent-correct>
<include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options>
</answer><answer><text>I protoni hanno maggiore energia cinetica.</text>
<feedback></feedback>
<correct>0</correct>
<percent-correct>0</percent-correct>
<include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options>
</answer><answer><text>I protoni e gli elettroni hanno la stessa energia cinetica.</text>
<feedback></feedback>
<correct>1</correct>
<percent-correct>100</percent-correct>
<include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options>
</answer><answer><text>I protoni e gli elettroni hanno la stessa quantit&amp;#x00e0; di moto.</text>
<feedback></feedback>
<correct>0</correct>
<percent-correct>0</percent-correct>
<include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options>
</answer></answers>
</question-record>
