<correct>1</correct>
<percent-correct>100</percent-correct>
<include-in-mc-options>1</include-in-mc-options>
</answer><answer><text>. . . acquista un&apos;accelerazione &amp;#x003C;i&amp;#x003E;M / (m+M) g&amp;#x003C;/i&amp;#x003E; verticale verso l&apos;alto.</text>
